PAGES.extend([
 {'slug':'watch-anime-online-india','title':'Watch Anime Online in India','intro':'Watch anime online in India with official YouTube uploads embedded on AniLove India. Hindi dubs, English subtitles and Japanese audio editions are labelled per title, and no account is needed to press play.','paragraphs':[('Legal anime streaming for Indian viewers','AniLove India collects only official uploads from reviewed publishers such as Muse Asia, Muse India, TMS and GUNDAM CHANNEL INTL. Videos stay on YouTube and play in the standard embedded player, so watching is free and legal. If a publisher has not made an upload available in India, YouTube controls that restriction and AniLove cannot override it.'),('Start with a complete season or a single episode','Some series below are one long complete-series compilation upload, which is ideal for binge watching in India. Others list individual episodes, so you can continue exactly where you stopped. Hindi-dubbed favourites such as SPY x FAMILY and That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime sit alongside English-subtitled classics from TMS.')],'faqs':[('Is it free to watch anime online in India here?','Yes. Listed titles play through official free YouTube uploads. AniLove charges nothing and requires no account.'),('Which anime are available in Hindi?','Use the Hindi Dubbed Anime collection for titles with a checked Hindi-audio edition. Language labels are given per season or edition.'),('Why does a video say it is unavailable in my country?','The uploader controls regional availability. Report the title through Contact so the catalogue can be reviewed.')],'kind':'anime-india'},
 {'slug':'hindi-movies-online','title':'Watch Hindi Movies Online — Full Movies','intro':'Watch full Hindi movies online through official YouTube uploads from Goldmines and Shemaroo Movies, embedded on AniLove India. Bollywood favourites and South Indian Hindi dubs are listed together.','paragraphs':[('Full movies, not clips','Every card below is backed by one checked full-length official upload. Trailers, scenes and songs are never substituted for a film. Open a title and choose Watch full movie to load its player page.'),('Bollywood and Hindi dubs in one place','This collection mixes original Hindi films such as Highway and Har Dil Jo Pyar Karega with popular Hindi-dubbed South Indian hits such as Kaithi and Son of Satyamurthy. The provider named on each title page is the official channel that uploaded the film.')],'faqs':[('Can I watch the full Hindi movie here?','Yes. Open a listed film and press Play on its dedicated page to load the official YouTube embed.'),('Do I need to sign up or pay?','No. AniLove requires no account, and the source uploads are free on YouTube.'),('How do I request a Hindi movie that is missing?','Search for the title, then use the request form to send Nitesh a WhatsApp message with the official source if you have one.')],'kind':'hindi-movies'},
 {'slug':'english-dubbed-anime-movies','title':'Watch English Dubbed Anime Movies','intro':'Choose English-dubbed anime movies from official YouTube uploads on AniLove India, including Akira and Fairy Tail the Movie: Phoenix Priestess, and play the full film here.','paragraphs':[('Dubbed films with actual players','Each film below has a checked full-length upload whose title explicitly identifies an English dub edition. That is different from a Japanese film with English subtitles, which has its own collection on AniLove. Open a movie and choose Watch full movie for its dedicated player page.'),('Know the edition before you play','Audio and subtitles are labelled separately on every title page. The uploader controls regional availability, embedding and how long a film stays online, so an edition can change after its catalogue check date.')],'faqs':[('Are these complete anime movies?','Yes. Each listed playable film is a checked feature-length upload, not a trailer or recap.'),('Where can I find subtitled anime movies instead?','See the Anime Movies with English Subtitles collection for Japanese-audio films with English caption tracks.'),('Is Akira available in English dub here?','Akira is listed in this collection from Anime Manga Official with an English dub full-movie upload.')],'kind':'dub-films'}
])

PAGES.extend([
 {'slug':'english-dubbed-anime','title':'Watch English Dubbed Anime Series Online','intro':'Watch English dubbed anime series through official YouTube uploads on AniLove India, from TMS classics such as Sonic X and Sherlock Hound to the English dub of Mobile Suit Gundam SEED.','paragraphs':[('Dubbed editions, labelled honestly','An English dub is a separate edition from a Japanese upload with English subtitles. This collection lists series with at least one checked English-audio season in the catalogue. Open a title and choose its English season tab to see the actual episodes.'),('Classic and modern dubs in one shelf','TMS Entertainment publishes English-dubbed full episodes of its classic series on YouTube, and GUNDAM CHANNEL INTL publishes the Gundam SEED English dub. Availability, episode counts and regional playback are controlled by those uploaders and can change after a catalogue check.')],'faqs':[('Can I watch English dubbed anime here for free?','Yes. Listed series play through official free YouTube uploads, and AniLove requires no account.'),('Is an English dub the same as English subtitles?','No. A dub replaces the dialogue audio with English voices; subtitles keep the original audio and add English text. Title pages label each edition separately.'),('Are full seasons dubbed?','Episode lists show the actual checked uploads per season. A season is only described as complete after every expected episode has been checked.')],'kind':'dub-anime'},
 {'slug':'watch-kdrama-online-india','title':'Watch K-Dramas Online in India','intro':'Watch Korean dramas online in India through official KBS WORLD TV uploads with English subtitles, embedded on AniLove India. No account is needed to open an episode and press play.','paragraphs':[('Official KBS uploads with English subtitles','Every drama in this collection comes from KBS WORLD TV, the official international channel of the Korean Broadcasting System. Episodes are Korean audio with English subtitles unless a title page labels a different edition. Daily dramas, weekend dramas and drama specials are listed with their actual uploaded episodes.'),('Start an episode, then continue in order','Open a drama to see its episode list. Numbered buttons follow the checked source uploads, so you can continue exactly where you stopped. If an episode number is missing, that upload was not found or did not pass checks; AniLove never substitutes fan uploads.')],'faqs':[('Can I watch K-dramas in India for free here?','Yes. Listed episodes play through official free KBS WORLD TV YouTube uploads. AniLove charges nothing and requires no account.'),('Are the K-dramas dubbed in Hindi?','The editions in this collection are Korean audio with English subtitles. Hindi-dubbed K-drama editions are not currently in the catalogue.'),('Why is an episode missing from a drama?','Episode lists reflect actual checked uploads. A missing number means the official upload was not found or failed verification, not that the episode does not exist.')],'kind':'kdrama-all'},
 {'slug':'anime-movies-online','title':'Watch Anime Movies Online — Full Films','intro':'Watch full anime movies online through official YouTube uploads on AniLove India: Akira, the Mobile Suit Gundam film trilogy, SPY x FAMILY CODE: White, Ramayana: The Legend of Prince Rama and more, each with a checked full-length source.','paragraphs':[('Full films with dedicated player pages','Every card below is backed by one checked feature-length official upload, never a trailer, recap or television compilation. Open a film and choose Watch full movie to reach its dedicated player page with the official YouTube embed.'),('Editions are labelled per film','Hindi dubs, English dubs and English-subtitled Japanese editions are labelled separately on each title page. Dedicated collections also exist for Hindi dubbed anime movies and English dubbed anime movies if you want one language only.')],'faqs':[('Are these really full anime movies?','Yes. Each listed film passed a full-runtime check against its official upload. Trailers and compilations are never substituted for films.'),('Do I need to sign up or pay?','No. AniLove requires no account, and the source uploads are free on YouTube.'),('Which anime movies are in Hindi?','Use the Hindi Dubbed Anime Movies collection for films with a checked Hindi-audio edition.')],'kind':'anime-movies-all'},
 {'slug':'jojos-bizarre-adventure-hindi','title':'Watch JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure in Hindi','intro':'Watch JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure in Hindi on AniLove India: Seasons 1, 2 and 3 are listed complete in Hindi from official Muse India uploads, with Season 4 still growing. No account needed.','paragraphs':[('Start with Phantom Blood, stay for Stardust Crusaders','Season 1 Hindi covers Phantom Blood (episodes 1–9) and Battle Tendency (episodes 10–26). Season 2 Hindi is the full 48-episode Stardust Crusaders run, and Season 3 Hindi completes the 39-episode Diamond is Unbreakable arc. Season 4 Hindi (Golden Wind) is listed with its checked episodes so far and grows as new uploads verify.'),('Hindi editions, kept separate','JoJo exists on AniLove in several editions: Hindi dubs from Muse India and Japanese editions with English subtitles from Muse Asia. Open the title, choose the Hindi season tab, and pick an episode. A Hindi label applies to that season only, and an uploader can restrict an episode by region even when embedding is enabled.')],'faqs':[('Is JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure complete in Hindi here?','Seasons 1, 2 and 3 Hindi are listed complete: 26, 48 and 39 episodes respectively. Season 4 Hindi is partial and grows as uploads verify.'),('Where should a new JoJo viewer start?','Start at Season 1 Episode 1 (Phantom Blood) and watch in order; Battle Tendency follows in the same season, then Stardust Crusaders in Season 2.'),('Are the Hindi episodes official?','Yes. The Hindi seasons come from Muse India’s official channel uploads, checked for channel identity, runtime, embedding metadata and India country metadata.')],'kind':'jojo','edition_table':True},
 {'slug':'assassination-classroom-hindi','title':'Watch Assassination Classroom in Hindi','intro':'Watch Assassination Classroom Season 1 in Hindi on AniLove India: all 22 episodes, including the 24 October 2026 finale, from official Muse India uploads.','paragraphs':[('A classroom with an impossible assignment','Class 3-E must assassinate their teacher — a super-powered being who also happens to be their best teacher. Season 1 Hindi follows the full 22-episode run from Muse India’s daily Hindi broadcast, which premiered on 3 October 2026 and ended with the finale on 24 October 2026.'),('Watch the finale in order','Open the title, choose the Season 1 Hindi tab, and pick any episode. Episode numbers follow the official uploads; if an episode shows a restriction, the uploader controls that availability and the episode can be reported from its page.')],'faqs':[('Is Assassination Classroom Season 1 complete in Hindi?','Yes. All 22 episodes are listed from Muse India’s Hindi broadcast run, including the finale.'),('Is there a Season 2 in Hindi?','Not on Muse India yet. No Season 2 Hindi uploads have been found, so nothing is listed for it.'),('Do I need an account to watch?','No. Episodes play in the official YouTube player on AniLove without signing up.')],'kind':'ac','edition_table':True},
 {'slug':'new-hindi-anime','title':'New Hindi Anime on AniLove India','intro':'The latest Hindi-dubbed anime checked into AniLove India’s catalogue: newly completed seasons, fresh episodes and new titles from official Muse India and Muse Hindi Dub uploads.','paragraphs':[('What is new right now','This shelf lists Hindi editions checked in the last 7 days, newest checks first. It includes the completed JoJo Hindi seasons, the Assassination Classroom Hindi finale, new titles such as The God of High School and Zom 100, and growing seasons such as Attack on Titan Season 3 Hindi.'),('Counts change as checks land','A title appears here because a Hindi season was recently checked, not because its whole season is complete. Open the title to see exactly which episodes are listed; partial seasons say so on their pages, and new episodes appear as verification runs confirm them.')],'faqs':[('How often does this shelf change?','Every catalogue build refreshes it from the latest Hindi season checks, so new completions and episodes appear here first.'),('Does “new” mean a newly released anime?','Not always. It means newly checked into this catalogue; an older series can appear when its Hindi uploads are verified.'),('Can I request a Hindi dub that is missing?','Yes. Search for the title, then use the request form to send Nitesh a WhatsApp message with the title and language you want.')],'kind':'recent-hindi','edition_table':True},
])

PAGES.extend([
 {'slug':'watch-hindi-anime-free-legally','title':'Watch Hindi Anime Free and Legally in India','intro':'Watch Hindi-dubbed anime free and legally in India on AniLove India: official YouTube uploads from Muse India and Muse Hindi Dub, played in YouTube’s own player with no account and no subscription.','paragraphs':[('Free because the source itself is free','The uploads embedded here are free on YouTube itself. AniLove does not sell a subscription, does not ask for an account, and does not host any video. You open a title, choose its Hindi season tab, and press play in the official player.'),('How to tell a legal Hindi dub from a re-upload','A legal Hindi dub on YouTube comes from the publisher’s own channel — Muse India or Muse Hindi Dub for most titles here. AniLove only lists uploads from identity-reviewed official channels, and never substitutes a fan re-upload. If an upload shows a region restriction, that is the uploader’s control, and the episode can be reported from its page.')],'faqs':[('Where can I watch Hindi dubbed anime for free and legally in India?','Right here on AniLove India. The anime series below are Hindi-dubbed editions from official Muse India and Muse Hindi Dub uploads, embedded in YouTube’s own player. Watching is free and needs no account.'),('Do I need an account or a subscription?','No. Episodes play in the official YouTube player on AniLove without signing up, and Watch later saves on this device without an account.'),('Are all Hindi seasons complete?','No. Hindi audio belongs to a particular season edition, not to a whole series. JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure Seasons 1, 2 and 3 and Assassination Classroom Season 1 are listed complete in Hindi; other Hindi seasons are still growing and say so on their title pages.')],'kind':'hindi-anime'},
])

